(Problem Statement) Tj
0 -13 Td
(Social media users face persistent risks from fake profiles, impersonation campaigns, spam ) Tj
0 -13 Td
(conversations, and phishing attempts. Most users cannot reliably identify sophisticated scam behavior,) Tj
0 -13 Td
( especially when attackers blend social engineering language with seemingly authentic profile ) Tj
0 -13 Td
(metadata. Existing controls are either platform-side and opaque or lightweight local filters with low ) Tj
0 -13 Td
(explainability. The project problem is to design and implement a practical system that detects profile) Tj
0 -13 Td
( and message risk in near real time, explains why a score was assigned, stores historical evidence for) Tj
0 -13 Td
( audit, and supports both end-user and administrator workflows without requiring enterprise-grade ) Tj
0 -13 Td
(infrastructure.) Tj
0 -13 Td
