(Extended Abstract \(5000+ words\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(This extended abstract presents Asset Defender, a hybrid cyber-safety platform designed to detect fake) Tj
0 -13 Td
( Instagram profiles, suspicious direct messages, scam campaigns, and account abuse patterns using a ) Tj
0 -13 Td
(combined architecture of machine learning, deterministic heuristics, browser extension telemetry, and ) Tj
0 -13 Td
(server-side risk fusion. The core research problem is operational: consumer users receive high volumes) Tj
0 -13 Td
( of social engineering attempts in messaging and profile contexts, yet most available safeguards are ) Tj
0 -13 Td
(either platform-level moderation that users cannot tune or simple keyword filters that produce ) Tj
0 -13 Td
(unstable detection quality. Asset Defender addresses this gap by combining multiple forms of evidence ) Tj
0 -13 Td
(and by presenting explainable risk output for both end users and administrators.) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
