(Workflow Description) Tj
0 -13 Td
(1\) User authentication and authorization via signup/login and JWT issuance.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(2\) Data acquisition through manual content input or extension-assisted scraping.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(3\) Client-side heuristics for profile structure, bio keywords, caption sentiment, and behavioral cues.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(4\) Server-side feature extraction for message threat and profile quality indicators.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(5\) ML inference using pre-trained models and optional fallback logic.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(6\) Risk fusion with confidence scoring and safety guards for insufficient evidence.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(7\) Persistence in SQLite analysis tables for user and admin retrieval.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(8\) Visualization in dashboard pages with recommendations and risk history.) Tj
